= Goodryke Resigns

Following the disastrous failure of the Heartland <i>Commonwealth intervention</i>, Goodryke has lost the support of DuFour and his camarilla, making his position untenable. It's expected that General Staal would be the successor to Goodryke, however, being the Defense Minister and mastermind of the failed coup has severely damaged his standing as well. With new elections coming up soon, DuFour may choose to keep Goodryke in office, until a successor can be found with a new, more right-wing Assembly.

